      "Deep inside a collapsed building, usable scrap and cans glint. The deeper you go, the more there is. But it's dark inside, and rumor has it no one has ever come back out.",
    "입구 근처만 훑는다": "Only search near the entrance",
    "적게 주웠지만 오늘 하루는 버텼다.":
      "You didn't find much, but you made it through the day.",
